a by 9th Corner\" title=\"Sonipat Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/103.avif\" alt=\"Interior project in Bhiwani, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Bhiwani Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What does an interior architect for showroom design do in Karnal?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">We plan the façade, display layout, lighting, customer route and storage, so your showroom stands out on busy roads and makes products easy to browse.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you design automobile and furniture showrooms?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Automobile, furniture, jewellery and apparel showrooms each need different display heights, lighting and space, and we plan around your product.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can a showroom follow a national brand's guidelines?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We adapt brand guidelines to your site, so the showroom meets the brand's standards while fitting the local building.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why hire an interior architect for showroom design early?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Early planning fixes services, lighting and display positions before work starts, which saves time and keeps the opening date on track.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Stand Out on GT Road</h2>\n            <p>Thousands of vehicles cross Karnal on GT Road every day. A skilled interior architect for showroom design gives your store the presence to bring some of them inside.</p><p>Planning a showroom in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Share your plans with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}